cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "ShotTo"
abstract: >-
  ShotTo is an Elixir implementation of NCPO-LNF, the βη-long normal form
  variant of the Computability Path Order of Niederhauser and Middeldorp, for
  ordering terms of Church's simple type theory as represented by ShotDs. It
  serves as the orientation order of the Shot higher-order tableau prover.
type: software
